SUMMARY:The Urban Orchestra Presents: Vienna Portraits
DESCRIPTION:Join The Urban Orchestra as we take you through an intimate portrait of Vienna before the 20th Century. Experience classical music as it was meant to be heard: up close and personal! \n \nEvent Schedule \nDoors Time \n– PRIX FIXE: 6:00 PM \n– GENERAL: 6:30 PM \nShow Time: 7:30 PM \n \nTicket Pricing \n$500 + Fees BENEFACTOR TIER: This Tier includes Premium Seating\, Prix Fixe Dinner\, and a Charitable Tax Receipt. \n$110 + Fees PRIX FIXE TIER: This Tier includes our Prix Fixe Menu and a Reserved Seat to the show. \n$40 + Fees GENERAL ADMISSION TIER: This Tier includes General Admission Seating on a first-come\, first-served basis. \n$25 + Fees ARTS WORKER/STUDENT TIER: This tier is for our friends who are Students and/or Arts Workers. Limited Number Available. \nElevate your concert experience by joining us for dinner before the show. To reserve a table\, please visit lula.ca/reservations or purchase a BENEFACTOR TIER or PRIX FIXE TIER ticket via Eventbrite. \n \nPRIX FIXE NOTES: \n-Prix Fixe menu includes paid upgrades. Please read the menu carefully when you dine with us. \n-Drinks not included. \n-Guests may be seated at a shared table. \n-Please reach out if you wish to be seated with groups you did not initially book with. \nINSTAGRAM: @urban_orchestra
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/the-urban-orchestra-presents-vienna-portraits/
LOCATION:Lula Lounge\, 1585 Dundas St W\, Toronto\, M6K 1T9
CATEGORIES:Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/the-urban-orchestra-presents-vienna-portraits.png
END:VEVENT
