SUMMARY:Please Stop The Music! - A Night of Musical Comedy (April 20)
DESCRIPTION:Come celebrate the sacred art of musical comedy with Toronto’s funniest musicians. Grab a drink\, listen and laugh. \nWelcome to Please Stop The Music! \nCome join us at Wenona Lodge on Bloor Street West in Toronto\, ON\, Canada for a night of Bo Burnham worship on April 20\, 2026 at 8:00 PM (Eastern Time). We have a stacked lineup of comedians you’ve seen at JFL\, The Fringe and all over the movies & tv. \nDon’t miss the opportunity to have a bunch of comedians sing at you. Please come. They need this. \nHosted bySpencer Glassman & Zoe Marín  \nWith Performances by:Potato PotatoRodrigo Fernandez-StollEve Parker FinleyKaylee Cavanagh Tiana Dueck  
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/please-stop-the-music-a-night-of-musical-comedy-april-20/
LOCATION:Wenona\, 1069 Bloor St W\, Toronto\, ON M6H 1M3\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6H 1M3
CATEGORIES:2SLGBTQ+,Comedy & Improv,Live Music,Performing Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/please-stop-the-music-a-night-of-musical-comedy-april-20.png
